// f32 `asin`, `acos` and `atan`, ported from LLVM libc into `core::libm`, against LLVM libc itself. For each
// input, given by its bits, this prints the bits of the 3 results (a NaN as 2143289344). The
// expected line is what LLVM libc at f475f085bf7b prints, built with FMA. The inputs are every input LLVM libc special-cases or lists as an exception and every boundary between the code's branches, each with its two neighbours and both signs; an input reaching each row of the 17-row table, directly and through 1/x; inputs across [-1, 1]; zeros, infinities, quiet and signaling NaNs and subnormals. The port was
// also checked against LLVM libc on all 2^32 inputs.
//
// EXPECT: 0 1070141403 0 1 1070141403 1 228737632 1070141403 228737632 847807906 1070141403 847807906 847807907 1070141403 847807907 847807908 1070141402 847807908 964689919 1070139355 964689919 964689920 1070139355 964689920 964689921 1070139355 964689921 964846113 1070139317 964846113 964846114 1070139317 964846114 964846115 1070139316 964846115 971544423 1070137681 971544422 971544425 1070137681 971544423 971544426 1070137681 971544424 981467137 1070133211 981467130 981467137 1070133211 981467131 981467138 1070133211 981467133 987681424 1070127142 987681403 1008981949 1070057515 1008981412 1025439479 1069815843 1025431642 1031804254 1069616773 1031776989 1031804255 1069616773 1031776990 1031804256 1069616773 1031776992 1032685559 1069561691 1032663490 1032685560 1069561691 1032663491 1032685561 1069561691 1032663491 1033149506 1069532695 1033123965 1033607108 1069504094 1033577807 1038609243 1069191461 1038512715 1040886228 1069005472 1040804037 1041910037 1068877496 1041797182 1044436119 1068561736 1044217824 1045140498 1068473688 1044884379 1046980465 1068243693 1046606225 1049012952 1067935013 1048722567 1049061612 1067922848 1048766555 1050358432 1067598643 1049920864 1051205641 1067386840 1050655337 1051671131 1067270468 1051051953 1053002399 1066937651 1052158027 1053448366 1066826159 1052518942 1054355240 1066599441 1053237583 1055733061 1066254985 1054289413 1055755569 1066249358 1054306190 1057052186 1065903310 1055312585 1057360529 1065749138 1055744823 1057360530 1065749138 1055744824 1057360531 1065749137 1055744826 1057554911 1065651947 1056012184 1057686092 1065586357 1056190377 1057686093 1065586356 1056190378 1057686094 1065586356 1056190380 1057772250 1065543277 1056306430 1058511715 1064993874 1057117566 1058802581 1064703008 1057299371 1059273807 1064231782 1057584635 1060062479 1063443111 1058036722 1060118867 1063386722 1058067845 1060882683 1062622906 1058473913 1061526379 1061979210 1058794099 1061740775 1061764814 1058896367 1062645175 10